ODW8502 `check_access_rights` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `check_access` instead, or `has_access` where a boolean is needed; an override belongs in `_check_access`.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:8:14
   |
 7 |     def deprecated_in_18(self):
 8 |         self.check_access_rights("read")
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 9 |         self.check_access_rule("write")
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
   |

ODW8502 [*] `check_access_rule` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `check_access` instead; an override belongs in `_check_access`.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:9:14
   |
 7 |     def deprecated_in_18(self):
 8 |         self.check_access_rights("read")
 9 |         self.check_access_rule("write")
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
11 |         self._filter_access_rules_python("read")
   |
help: Replace with `check_access`
   |
8  |         self.check_access_rights("read")
   -         self.check_access_rule("write")
9  +         self.check_access("write")
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

ODW8502 [*] `_filter_access_rules` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `_filtered_access` instead; an override belongs in `_check_access`.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:10:14
   |
 8 |         self.check_access_rights("read")
 9 |         self.check_access_rule("write")
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
11 |         self._filter_access_rules_python("read")
12 |         self._check_recursion()
   |
help: Replace with `_filtered_access`
   |
9  |         self.check_access_rule("write")
   -         self._filter_access_rules("read")
10 +         self._filtered_access("read")
11 |         self._filter_access_rules_python("read")
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

ODW8502 [*] `_filter_access_rules_python` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `_filtered_access` instead; an override belongs in `_check_access`.
